# AI-native UI quality

- Prefer Ant Design. Do not add parallel UI libraries (MUI, Chakra, Mantine, etc.).
- Intentional colors/fonts/radius live only in `src/theme/theme.config.ts` (optional `colorPrimary`). Business TSX uses `theme.useToken()` / component APIs.
- New ListCRUD / Auth / Dashboard / Shell / Error pages must structurally align with golden paths in each app’s `.github/instructions/frontend.instructions.md`.
- Do not extract shared modules without a third call site. Do not invent governance packages while coding features.
- After UI changes: `pnpm check` (or `vp check --no-fmt`), then `pnpm verify:ui`. Fix the same violations at most twice, then stop.
